{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "140", "x": 0.895551985636664, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03819126296697169, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "[ Examiner's comment]", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.24402835717192298, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Here is the examiner's comment:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1613150258338729, "w": 0.33792801476933476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This is generally a good response, and it presents the key stages shown in the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19958322765056533, "w": 0.825924649490251, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "process. There is an overview, but it is rather generic and only tells us how many", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.22791365316748796, "w": 0.8260140512499689, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "main stages there are [main stages...are numbered from 1 to 8]. To improve the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2562440032416256, "w": 0.8260117957009852, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "overview, instead of reporting the number of stages, there should be a summary", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2846114711659939, "w": 0.826099044436673, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of the main stages.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.31294182124013153, "w": 0.19823838035999178, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Ideas are arranged logically. There are some nice linking expressions, appropriate", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.351061683680775, "w": 0.8263316735568562, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "for a 'process' [The first stage I then I During the next phase I which is] but there", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.37939210919769767, "w": 0.8258812814347917, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "is some repetition [The first stage I The second phase I third and the forth stages", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4077224592718353, "w": 0.825707194063231, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I next phase I seventh stage I eighth phase]. Most of the sentences start on a new", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4360528470673654, "w": 0.8262753873572174, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "line - this means paragraphing is not present.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.46438319714150306, "w": 0.4625332552503285, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Vocabulary is appropriate and spelling is generally well managed but there are", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5026761819130752, "w": 0.8260336335161456, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "errors. Grammatical structures are mixed but errors in verb forms are noticeable,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5310065319872127, "w": 0.826661086233431, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "particularly in passive structures [are cutting / are cut I are being undergone /", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5591885992673902, "w": 0.8258812814347917, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "undergo].", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5875189493415278, "w": 0.10203802435234217, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "To achieve a higher score, the candidate should present an overview which", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6257871888796128, "w": 0.8260989419117193, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "summarises the main stages and paragraphing should be used to better organise", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6541176143965354, "w": 0.8267690450097875, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the stages.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6824850068781187, "w": 0.11755908487456533, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}